WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Mission log, day forty. The teaspoon is still in orbit.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Ground control wants to know how it got out there.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I have chosen not to answer that question.

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
It passes the window every ninety minutes, shining.

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Some nights it is the brightest thing in the sky.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Some nights I wave.
